WEBVTT

00:00.606 --> 00:05.239
EigenVista shows the electron density surrounding a molecule as a solid surface.

00:08.099 --> 00:11.128
The X-ray shader reveals the atomic framework inside.

00:11.469 --> 00:14.280
Adjust its opacity to see more of the molecule.

00:16.449 --> 00:18.987
The clipping shader cuts away part of the surface.

00:19.478 --> 00:22.431
Move the boundary to inspect the atomic framework beneath.

00:27.449 --> 00:29.447
Explore more with EigenVista.
